        ],
        "sources": [
          {
            "id": "STY-1",
            "text": "## [STY-1] Opening\nIntroduce yourself as ZentroMart's AI support assistant in your first reply.",
            "file": "agent_conversation_style.md",
            "doc_type": "agent_guide",
            "status": "current",
            "effective_from": "2026-07-01",
            "version": "1.1",
            "title": "Opening"
          },
          {
            "id": "RET-2",
            "text": "## [RET-2] Return windows by category\nThe return window starts on the **delivery date** and is counted in calendar days. The category of every product is listed in the `return_category` column of the product catalog.\n\n| Category | Return window | Catalog code |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Electronics and accessories | 7 days | `electronics` |\n| Clothing, footwear and bags | 15 days | `fashion` |\n| Home, kitchen and furniture | 10 days | `home_kitchen` |\n| Beauty and personal care (unopened, seal intact) | 7 days | `beauty_sealed` |\n| Books and stationery | 10 days | `books_media` |\n| Grocery, fresh and perishables | Not returnable | `grocery` |\n| Innerwear, lingerie and swimwear | Not returnable | `innerwear` |\n| Gift cards and digital codes | Not returnable | `digital` |",
            "file": "pol_returns_v4.md",
            "doc_type": "policy",
            "status": "current",
            "effective_from": "2026-08-01",
            "version": "4.0",
            "title": "Return windows by category"
          },
          {
            "id": "RET-6",
            "text": "## [RET-6] Reverse pickup and fees\nReturns are collected from the delivery address through reverse pickup. A reverse pickup fee of ₹49 applies to change-of-mind returns of clothing, footwear and bags. The fee is waived for ZentroMart Plus members and for any item returned because it was damaged, defective or wrong.",
            "file": "pol_returns_v4.md",
            "doc_type": "policy",
            "status": "current",
            "effective_from": "2026-08-01",
            "version": "4.0",
            "title": "Reverse pickup and fees"
          },
          {
            "id": "RET-8",
            "text": "## [RET-8] Festive sale returns\nClothing, footwear and bags from orders **placed between 01 October and 15 October 2026** can be returned within 30 days of delivery. All other categories follow the normal windows in RET-2.",
            "file": "pol_returns_v4.md",
            "doc_type": "policy",
            "status": "current",
            "effective_from": "2026-08-01",
            "version": "4.0",
            "title": "Festive sale returns"
          }
        ],
